    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="23">
        <head>Cn 1018 23</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#kennedy" n="23" corresp="#wit-d">And fyrdunga eac swa á þonne þearf sy. for gemǽnelicre neode.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">and fyrdunga eac swa a þonne þearf sy, for gemænelicre neode.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#kennedy" corresp="#wit-d">And military service also [should be undertaken] for the common need, whenever it is required.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">and also the provisioning of the army as the need arises, for the common good.</ab>
      </div>
